<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1487502645"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1534998918"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="人生進行形"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="May'n"/><amll:meta key="album" value="15Colors -nu skool-"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:53.904"><div begin="00:26.920" end="03:37.582"><p begin="00:26.920" end="00:29.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">白紙のページのさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盯着空白的纸页</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ku shi no pe e ji no sa</span></p><p begin="00:29.433" end="00:31.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">何を見つめてるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟是在看什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni wo mi tsu me te ru no</span></p><p begin="00:31.353" end="00:33.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">波の匂いは遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远方海潮的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi no ni o i wa to o ku</span></p><p begin="00:33.969" end="00:35.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">夏を運ぶ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将夏日送来身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu wo ha ko bu</span></p><p begin="00:35.854" end="00:38.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">今日もつらいよ 痛いよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也好难过 好痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u mo tsu ra i yo i ta i yo</span></p><p begin="00:38.467" end="00:40.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">って立ち尽くす様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伫立原地似乎无法挪步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te ta chi tsu ku su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:40.392" end="00:42.773" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">時間だけ過ぎてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忧郁的情绪中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji ka n da ke su gi te ku</span></p><p begin="00:43.048" end="00:44.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">憂いの中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有时间悄然流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u re i no na ka</span></p><p begin="00:45.590" end="00:47.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">不意に思い出した記憶の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不经意回想起 记忆之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i ni o mo i da shi ta ki o ku no na ka</span></p><p begin="00:48.249" end="00:49.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">変わらぬ世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个从未改变的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra nu se ka i</span></p><p begin="00:49.524" end="00:52.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">なんでもないはずの 思い出だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有回忆 仿佛风平浪静无事发生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de mo na i ha zu no o mo i de da ke</span></p><p begin="00:54.696" end="00:58.171" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">僕ら夏へと駆け出した環状線<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都乘坐着奔向夏日的环状线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra na tsu he to ka ke da shi ta ka n jo u se n</span></p><p begin="00:58.514" end="01:00.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">「またね、明日」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说完“明天见”后静静等待着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ma ta ne a shi ta 」 't te ma 't te ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:00.256" end="01:02.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">待ってるよ音の方へ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to no ho u he</span></p><p begin="01:03.116" end="01:07.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">何も知らないからまだ人生三年目<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为一无所知才平静度过人生的三年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo shi ra na i ka ra ma da ji n se i sa n ne n me</span></p><p begin="01:07.615" end="01:09.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">このまま知ったこと 覚えててよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样将所知的一切铭记吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma shi 't ta ko to o bo e te te yo</span></p><p begin="01:10.191" end="01:12.767" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">大人までに 嗚呼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到长大成人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na ma de ni a a</span></p><p begin="01:13.601" end="01:16.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">仰ぐ 風 ただ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悠然 仰望长风</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o gu ka ze ta da</span></p><p begin="01:18.147" end="01:21.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">愛 知らぬ まま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知 爱为何物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi ra nu ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:39.336" end="01:41.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">図らずに夜へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无防备地独自彷徨在黑夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ka ra zu ni yo ru he to hi to ri sa ma yo 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:41.905" end="01:43.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">独り彷徨っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自一人彷徨无措</span></p><p begin="01:43.800" end="01:46.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">変われない自分を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为难以做出改变而无比自责</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa re na i ji bu n wo shi ka 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:46.379" end="01:47.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">叱っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断自责</span></p><p begin="01:48.350" end="01:50.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">だって苦いよ疲れたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为很痛苦啊 很疲惫啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da 't te ni ga i yo tsu ka re ta yo</span></p><p begin="01:50.917" end="01:52.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">失敗、また自己採点<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失败后 又开始自我评判</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 'p pa i ma ta ji ko sa i te n</span></p><p begin="01:52.893" end="01:55.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">余計なこと知っちゃって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">知道得太多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ke i na ko to shi 'c cha 't te</span></p><p begin="01:55.426" end="01:56.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">動けぬまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被牵绊在原地动弹不得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u go ke nu ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:58.060" end="01:59.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">ねぇ伝う感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 传达的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne tsu ta u ka n jo u</span></p><p begin="01:59.662" end="02:00.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">名前もない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并没有姓名</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ma e mo na i</span></p><p begin="02:00.706" end="02:01.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">分かんないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我懵懵懂懂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka n na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:02.016" end="02:06.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">なんでもないはずの夢の続きへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走向本该风平浪静的梦境后续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de mo na i ha zu no yu me no tsu zu ki he</span></p><p begin="02:07.061" end="02:10.572" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">今日は独りで漂ってる半透明<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天 本该独自漂浮的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u wa hi to ri de ta da yo 't te ru ha n to u me i</span></p><p begin="02:10.929" end="02:12.309" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">みたいな少年は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛半透明的少年</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta i na sho u ne n wa</span></p><p begin="02:12.421" end="02:15.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">無垢なままでそこに居てよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依旧纯洁无垢 请留在那里吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ku na ma ma de so ko ni i te yo</span></p><p begin="02:15.565" end="02:18.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">何も知らなくていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一无所知也没关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo shi ra na ku te i i</span></p><p begin="02:18.078" end="02:19.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">まだ人生進行形<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生还在进行中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ji n se i shi n ko u ke i</span></p><p begin="02:20.032" end="02:22.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">つらいなら知ったこと忘れてもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ra i na ra</span></p><p begin="02:22.592" end="02:25.268" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">大人までに 嗚呼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到长大成人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na ma de ni a a</span></p><p begin="02:26.009" end="02:28.649" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">海 君へ 問う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大海 向你询问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u mi ki mi he to u</span></p><p begin="02:30.572" end="02:33.366" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">いつか また 笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将来 定能再次欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ma ta wa ra u</span></p><p begin="02:43.310" end="02:46.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">独りで また雨宿り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次 独自檐下躲雨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri de ma ta a ma ya do ri</span></p><p begin="02:47.796" end="02:51.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">ふとした 感情に迷う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为突如其来的感情 感到迷惘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu to shi ta ka n jo u ni ma yo u</span></p><p begin="02:52.350" end="02:55.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">このまま居れたらいいね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果能维持现状该多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma i re ta ra i i ne</span></p><p begin="02:56.861" end="02:59.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">夢の中笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿能在梦中欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me no na ka wa ra u</span></p><p begin="03:01.428" end="03:04.886" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">僕ら夏へと駆け出した環状線<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都乘坐着奔向夏日的环状线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra na tsu he to ka ke da shi ta ka n jo u se n</span></p><p begin="03:05.328" end="03:06.989" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">「またね、明日」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说完“明天见”后静静等待着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ma ta ne a shi ta 」 't te ma 't te ru yo</span></p><p begin="03:07.034" end="03:09.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">待ってるよ音の方へ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to no ho u he</span></p><p begin="03:09.896" end="03:12.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">何も知らなくていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一无所知也没关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo shi ra na ku te i i</span></p><p begin="03:12.394" end="03:14.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">ただ今日を覚えていて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需将今日铭记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da kyo u wo o bo e te i te</span></p><p begin="03:14.982" end="03:19.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">遠く記憶の中 揺れる長い影に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遥远记忆中 那瘦长的身影轻轻摇曳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku ki o ku no na ka yu re ru na ga i ka ge ni</span></p><p begin="03:20.430" end="03:23.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">仰ぐ 風 ただ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悠然 仰望长风</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o gu ka ze ta da</span></p><p begin="03:24.949" end="03:27.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">愛 知る まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至 懂得何为爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi ru ma de</span></p><p begin="03:29.429" end="03:32.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">夜 君に 逢う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜晚 与你相逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru ki mi ni a u</span></p><p begin="03:33.946" end="03:37.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">ほら また 笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你瞧 不禁再次欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ma ta wa ra u</span></p></div></body></tt>